<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Payment status</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script></head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4"><main class="max-w-lg w-full bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 shadow-xl p-8 text-center"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-violet-100 text-violet-600 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-3xl">✓</div><h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-5">Payment submitted</h1><p class="text-slate-500 mt-2">Return to the app to securely verify the order. Access is enabled only after Cashfree confirms payment.</p><div class="mt-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-50 p-3 text-xs text-slate-500 break-all">Order: <%= orderId || 'Unavailable' %></div></main></body></html>
